        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Broadcast",
        "text": "Course set. Drizzles observed. Wayside stations will allow passage."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Broadcast",
        "text": "Incoming telegram from Viscount Dawson. They would like to use this journey as an opportunity to meet with the Dublinn representative."
    },
    {
