    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "More nobles coming over to our side."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "Don't you worry. The Leader won't deign to make them any statements."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "Did they think a simple show of friendliness would earn them a guarantee of peace from Dublinn, a Taran population kept in check?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "I say at some point, they need to learn what constitutes true sincerity."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "The Leader is still sending you to negotiate?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "Perhaps I <i>should</i> fritter away some more time, at least enough that people forget about me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "Good to hear. You've made your share of errors by my standards."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "Heheh... well, since you came back to report on your lonesome, I take it you haven't caught Loughshinny yet?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "Don't ask rhetorical questions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "You hindered my ranks in their search, only to then leak her prior trail to my men. Not exactly a smart way to save someone, in your case."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "And how do you know it wasn't you I was saving?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "You know, I don't recall The Leader ever saying anything about executing her. Do you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "The Leader did allow her to roam free. The Leader also allowed me to deal with her at my own discretion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "Don't blame me for being harsh on your friend, Harmonie. In these times, no one in their right mind would let a Draco act freely in Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "Oh, never you mind that. I don't think we were ever that close, anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "And you see, I'm about to pay a visit to that medical organization she was holing up in."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie",
        "text": "Hm-hm-hmm! Maybe, just maybe, I'll be the first to get her."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
