    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "Yes, I did not bring her back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "She has no resolve to fight, but is plenty capable of fleeing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "Further to which... we pursued her tracks to where the old Taran palace stood. The fires within the ruins have gone out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "Becoming Infected may have changed her Originium Arts."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
