    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "You seem to think it was Oripathy that made her stronger?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "Heh... of course not."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "She's my sister. It would be disappointing if she couldn't even hold her own."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "Tell me. Who's with her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier",
        "text": "A few vagrants. She calls herself the Leader before them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "Then there's no need to follow her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "Since she has at last awakened, and become aware of her power as a Draco..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eblana",
        "text": "She will return to me soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
