        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Are you sure the long-haul trucks pass through here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Aye, I hitched on one when I fled Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...Bagpipe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Eh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Do you remember when I asked you... what the truth you wanted was, and what you wanted to do after learning it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Because you knew things would turn out this way. Most things that happen in Victoria end up as a power struggle like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Mm, you could say... but it's never the same people involved, each time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "My feelings still haven't changed. I have to submit my report."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "I just wonder, you know... when will any part of Victoria truly accept it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "What can I even do, personally speakin', to speed up that process?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You still want to change Victoria, after all this? It amazes me how you're so..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "So what? Stupid? Stubborn?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "So strong."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "Come on, Chenchen, that's why we've always been friends, na? We fixate on a goal and don't change it easily. Not me, not you, not my leader!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Ha. Doesn't seem like a compliment when it's from you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe",
        "text": "And I've been thinkin' these days, anyway... who's to say someone else's dream can't be achieved, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
