    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "At a massive rumbling, they both turn around."
    },
    {
        "text": "A huge shadow looms on the horizon, the earth trembling beneath their feet."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "W-What's that sound?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "No. Nonono, what's THAT?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "An army?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "Yesterday, 400km away, I signed off on a reconnaissance mission scouting this force."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "All along, I've been of the belief that with his militant vice grip, the Iron Duke is our greatest enemy."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "With his support, Dublinn will incite hatred amongst the population, dragging innocent people into riot and even outright war. We must find a way to check his power."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "Hundreds, if not thousands of lives, hinge upon my every move."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "But as for the moment..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "He could not let out a sound if he tried."
    },
    {
        "text": "Rumble. Rumble."
    },
    {
        "text": "The battle fleet, led by a grand high-speed battleship, sails along its set course."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the territory of Duke Caster. She has silently assented to all this, assented to war passing through her roads and across Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "...Flee, Taran."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "You built your house in the wrong place."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "W-Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "This belt remains the territory of Duke Caster. The boundary is vague, and you have yet to cross it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "The Marquess of Trent did not switch over to the Duke of Wellington's side come the conclusion of negotiations. Moreover, pressure on the Tarans is set to increase once again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "Perhaps you'll sight those brutal patrol squads again in the next two days. Perhaps they haven't forgotten the appearance of your name in the case files."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "Did he mistake the Duke's intentions? Is he simply another pawn sacrificed in this war?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "None of us know the answer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fischer",
        "text": "And if we did, that lone hut would not be built in a wrong place."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "Er, what <i>are</i> you going on about..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "\u2014Wait, I remember now! You! You're the one who came after us back then!"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fionn",
        "text": "W-What are you trying to..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_cardoorc",
            "volume": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$sportscarstart",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Fischer does not answer. He simply turns, gets back in the car, and starts the engine."
    },
    {
        "text": "Behind him, the sound of the tiny brick hut collapsing, and the plaintive cry of the villager, are drowned out in the deep cacophony of the battleship at the head."
    },
